odot/pull/115218.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-27T15:09:23Z"},"body":"I didn't know that `SDL_GetJoystickName()` can return a UTF8 string, but I just tried one of my DirectInput controllers and in Godot 4.5 it returns a partially garbled `raw_name`:\r\n```gdscript\r\n\tprint(Input.get_joy_name(0), \" \", Input.get_joy_guid(0))\r\n\tprint(Input.get_joy_info(0))\r\n```\r\n```\r\nNEXT SNES Controller 0300c1871008000001e5000000000000\r\n{ \"raw_name\": \"(Ð¡ÑÐ°Ð½Ð´Ð°ÑÑÐ½ÑÐµ ÑÐ¸ÑÑÐµÐ¼Ð½ÑÐµ ÑÑÑÑÐ¾Ð¹ÑÑÐ²Ð°) usb gamepad\", \"vendor_id\": \"2064\", \"product_id\": \"58625\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\r\n```\r\nWith this fix `raw_name` is now readable (in this case, to a Russian speaker):\r\n```\r\nNEXT SNES Controller 0300c1871008000001e5000000000000\r\n{ \"raw_name\": \"(Стандартные системные устройства) usb gamepad\", \"vendor_id\": \"2064\", \"product_id\": \"58625\", \"xinput_index\": \"0\" }\r\n```\r\n(For anyone curious, the text in parentheses reads \"Standard system devices\")\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengi